# {{lb|en|transitive}} To bring (a thing) [[up to date]].
#: {{ux|en|I need to '''update''' my records to take account of the most recent transaction.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To bring (a person) up to date: to inform (a person) about recent developments.
#: {{ux|en|'''Update''' me on what happened while I was away.}}
# {{lb|en|ambitransitive|Bayesian [[epistemology]]}} To change one's [[credence]] in a [[proposition]] in response to new [[evidence]].
#: {{ux|en|I need to '''update''' on the new data.}}
#: {{ux|en|How can I [[update one's priors|'''update''' my priors]]?}}

